===Luminous Legends Y Global Challenge Rewards===
As part of the [https://pokemongo.nianticlabs.com/post/luminouslegends-y-2021/?hl=en Luminous Legends Y] event, players were given the global challenge to defeat a total of 25,000,000 {{tc|Team GO Rocket Grunt}}s, starting from May 15, 2021, at 12:00 a.m. to May 23, 2021, at 11:59 p.m. UTC, with progress being tracked on Twitter. The rewards for completing the challenge were a 3× catch XP multiplier, along with {{rf|Galarian}} {{p|Zigzagoon}} appearing in level 1 raids with a chance of its [[Shiny Pokémon (GO)|Shiny]] variant being found, starting from May 25, 2021, at 10:00 a.m. to May 31, 2021, at 8:00 p.m. local time. Another reward existed for those participating in the [https://pokemongolive.com/post/specialweekend2021/ May 2021 Special Weekend], the bonus being that all participants would gain a 4× XP multiplier as opposed to 2×. The challenge was announced to have been accomplished on May 20, 2021.<ref>[https://twitter.com/PokemonGoApp/status/1395470787184898048 Twitter announcement]</ref>

